        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dxzw1zwez/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_600/adam_misty_owners_mkopqr.jpg" alt="Adam and Misty Bussey, owners of Blue River Gutters">
        <p class="image-caption">Adam & Misty Bussey, Owners</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-content">
        <h2>The Story Behind Blue River</h2>
        <p>Here's the deal: we started Blue River Gutters because we saw too many homeowners getting mediocre work from contractors who didn't stick around to fix problems.</p>
        <p>We're based in Hartselle, born and raised in North Alabama. When we show up to your house, we're not strangers passing through — we're your neighbors. We shop at the same stores, deal with the same red clay drainage problems, and watch the same weather forecasts wondering if another spring storm is coming.</p>
        <p>After 20+ years in this business, we've learned something: the difference between a gutter job that lasts and one that fails usually comes down to who's doing the work and whether they care about getting it right.</p>
        <p>We care. Every job we do has our name on it. And in a small community like this, your reputation is everything.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

