{# Local Roots #}
<section class="about-local">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid reverse">
      <div class="about-content">
        <h2>North Alabama Is Home</h2>
        <p>We serve Huntsville, Madison, Decatur, Athens, Hartselle, and all the communities in between — about a 30-mile radius from our home base.</p>
        <p>Why does local matter? Because we understand what your home is dealing with. The pine needles that fall year-round. The red clay that doesn't drain. The spring storms that dump two inches of rain in an hour. The humidity that rots fascia boards faster than you'd expect.</p>
        <p>When you work with us, you're working with someone who's dealt with these same problems on their own house. That's not something a national chain can offer.</p>
        <p>Plus, we're not going anywhere. We've been here for 20+ years and we plan to be here for 20 more. When you call with a question or a problem five years from now, we'll still be around to help.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-image">
